 	{ MODKEY|ShiftMask,             XK_l,      spawn,          {.v = lockcmd } },
+	{ MODKEY|ShiftMask,             XK_e,      spawn,          {.v = menucmd } },
 	{ 0,                            XF86XK_MonBrightnessUp,    spawn,          SHCMD ("brightnessctl set +10%" BARREFRESH)},
 	{ 0,                            XF86XK_MonBrightnessDown,  spawn,          SHCMD ("brightnessctl set 10%-" BARREFRESH)},
 	{ 0,                            XF86XK_AudioLowerVolume,   spawn,          SHCMD ("wpctl set-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ 5%-" BARREFRESH)},
diff --git a/dwm.1 b/dwm.1
index 77dc6ee..5e6f911 100644
--- a/dwm.1
+++ b/dwm.1
@@ -151,6 +151,12 @@ Quit dwm.
 .B Mod1\-Shift\-w
 Restart dwm, for example to run a newly installed build.
 .TP
+.B Mod1\-Shift\-e
+Open the power menu,
+.BR fdwm-menu ,
+in dmenu: lock, suspend, restart dwm, log out, reboot or power off. Log out,
+reboot and power off ask again first.
+.TP
 .B XF86MonBrightnessUp, XF86MonBrightnessDown
 Raise or lower the screen brightness by 10% with
 .BR brightnessctl (1).
